{"nodes": [{"id": "src_app_features_informe_expulsion_informe_expulsion", "label": "Informe previo de expulsi\u00f3n", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "src/app/features/informe-expulsion/informe-expulsion.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_app_features_informe_expulsion_informe_expulsion_comision", "label": "Comisi\u00f3n de tres firmas del informe de expulsi\u00f3n", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "src/app/features/informe-expulsion/informe-expulsion.html", "source_location": "L22-L27, L176-L228", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Toda expulsi\u00f3n o cancelaci\u00f3n de matr\u00edcula requiere informe previo de una comisi\u00f3n de tres personas (profesor jefe, coordinador de convivencia, equipo t\u00e9cnico pedag\u00f3gico). Cada integrante firma con su propia sesi\u00f3n: no se puede firmar por otro."}, {"id": "src_app_features_informe_expulsion_informe_expulsion_decision", "label": "Decisi\u00f3n del director y plazos de informe", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "src/app/features/informe-expulsion/informe-expulsion.html", "source_location": "L230-L325", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "5 d\u00edas h\u00e1biles desde la notificaci\u00f3n al apoderado para informar a Superintendencia y SEREMI, calculados con feriados: es un plazo legal, no un recordatorio. Si el informe no recomienda la medida y el director la aplica igual, la ley exige fundamentar de forma pormenorizada, y la UI lo marca como campo obligatorio."}], "edges": [{"source": "src_app_features_informe_expulsion_informe_expulsion", "target": "claude_formato_fecha", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/app/features/informe-expulsion/informe-expulsion.html", "source_location": "L109, L241, L254, L261", "weight": 1.0}, {"